<title>DENMARK: Denmark's KFK H1 1997 profit declines.</title>
<headline>Denmark's KFK H1 1997 profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		34    vs    90</p>
<p>Group operating result</p>
<p> before financial items	    19    vs    21</p>
<p> Group net turnover	     4,799    vs    3,873</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of leading Danish grain and feedstuffs wholesaler is A/S Korn og Foderstof Kompagniet (KFK). It said in a statement that it expected full year 1997 in line with 1996's 75 million crown group net profit.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
